	(descr "Raspberry Pi Radio Module 2 (RM2, RMC20452T): CYW43439 WiFi 4 + Bluetooth 5.2, 14.5x16.5x2.55 mm, 21 castellated pads on a 1.5 mm pitch. Datasheet figure 6 land pattern with the lands 0.5 mm longer on the outside (2.5x1.0 mm) for hand soldering. Antenna end up; RF keep-out (no metal) drawn on Cmts.User. https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/rm2/rm2-datasheet.pdf")
	(tags "RM2 RMC20452T CYW43439 WiFi Bluetooth Raspberry Pi radio module castellated")
